                                                "sense_id": "8cd8eb2c-ddfd-3604-ba8c-751ff3cb677f",
                                                "text": "Aw, that's a cute little birdie. Is it a budgie?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "695213aa-4c64-4438-8d06-5bc2295144da",
                                                "sense_id": "8cd8eb2c-ddfd-3604-ba8c-751ff3cb677f",
                                                "text": "'Listen to th' birdies,' said the child, raising her radiant face to the roof, and at the supreme moment accompanying them in perfect mimicry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77995b30-ab39-359b-84c7-6651cee1e642",
